> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

> REVIEW: Missing main ingredient added without invented amount: egg whites

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @trader joe's vegetable hash{1/2%cup}, @skinless chicken tender{1%oz}, @mozzarella cheese{3/10%cup}, @egg whites{}.

== Preparation ==

Cook the chicken tender fully, then combine with warmed vegetable hash. Add the missing egg whites and cook until set; melt in mozzarella. Egg-white quantity needs review.
